@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@metaVerifyToken = REEMPLAZA_CON_TU_VERIFY_TOKEN

### Health webhook Meta WhatsApp
GET {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/meta/whatsapp/health
Accept: application/json

### Verificar webhook (Meta ejecuta esta solicitud al guardar la URL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/meta/whatsapp?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.verify_token={{metaVerifyToken}}&hub.challenge=challenge_local
Accept: text/plain

### El POST real debe venir firmado por Meta con X-Hub-Signature-256.
### Configura en Meta Developers esta callback URL:
### https://TU-DOMINIO/webhooks/meta/whatsapp
